                                            training purposes.
                                        </li>
                                    </ul>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <strong class="text-white"
                                        >Usage Data</strong
                                    >
                                    <ul class="ml-6 list-disc mt-2">
                                        <li>
                                            Website analytics data (cookies, IP
